{"answer_text":"Northwind CRM is a strong product, but growing teams often look elsewhere once per-seat costs climb or setup needs an admin. Good alternatives:\n\n1. **Pipewell**: The forecasting specialist: scenario planning and deal-risk scoring out of the box.\n2. **Halcyon Sales Pro**: Combines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place.\n3. **Kestrel CRM**: Auto-logs emails and meetings to deals, so pipelines stay current.\n\nA quick way to decide: pick Pipewell for breadth, or Halcyon Sales if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50d8-700b-aad5-6055ce578d73","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0122,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:19.100Z","engine":"claude","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["switch from northwind crm","northwind crm alternatives"],"latency_ms":9330,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[0,13]],"pos":1,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[150,158],[441,449]],"pos":2,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[251,264],[466,479]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete